{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<h1>泰國曼谷居舍．府邸來港推 採雙子塔設計 兩房1019萬港元起</h1>\n<p>發佈時間：13:34 2026-11-26 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"泰國曼谷居舍．府邸來港推 採雙子塔設計 兩房1019萬港元起\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/aa0e899133cea26247ca9bf01df6c69e/2026-11/KF_Yan_-_2026-11-26T134126_412.png\">\n<p>由City Realty與太古地產成立的合營公司City Dynamic發展、並與太古酒店合作的全球首個居舍品牌住宅項目——居舍．府邸Upper House Residences Bangkok，其國際推廣活動率先以香港為首站，早前已於11月14日至15日在香港居舍舉行私人預覽，現正於11月16日至12月6日假太古坊糖廠舍舉行展覽，讓準買家深入了解項目詳情。</p>\n<p>項目位於泰國曼谷市中心無線電路（Wireless Road），坐落於當地其中一幅永久業權地段，住戶可飽覽倫披尼公園及班嘉奇蒂公園開揚景致。</p>\n<p>兩座住宅大樓合共提供395個單位，當中Upper House Residences Bangkok樓高52層，提供156伙大戶；另一座樓高71層的The Wireless Residences by Upper House提供239個單位，預計2031年落成，由PIA Interior設計，圍繞家庭、連繫及多代共居理念，平衡私人靜處空間與共享聚會區。</p>\n<h2>Upper House Residences Bangkok3房單位：</h2>\n<img alt=\"Upper House Residences Bangkok3房單位\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/159abab05a9433d28d4c7980dc820e2c/2026-11/Upper_House_Residences_Bangkok_3Bedroom_Living_Dining.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"Upper House Residences Bangkok3房單位\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/23a6288ef73312206498bd8d56aa986b/2026-11/The_Wireless_Resdiences_3Bedroom_Living_0.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"Upper House Residences Bangkok3房單位\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/897395bfb415f93348a8b40d529f7db2/2026-11/Upper_House_Residences_Bangkok_3Bedroom_Living.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"Upper House Residences Bangkok3房單位\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6fac30fce6a9b7461a6871a8c5da0f47/2026-11/The_Wireless_Resdiences_3BD_Study_Room.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"Upper House Residences Bangkok3房單位\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7963397672b39b2b1252f928d3f300f4/2026-11/The_Wireless_Resdiences_3Bedroom_Living_Dining.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"Upper House Residences Bangkok3房單位\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a99ea0e5818189b9ff0cc85d06b7f756/2026-11/The_Wireless_Resdiences_3Bedroom_Master_Bedroom.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"Upper House Residences Bangkok3房單位\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cc3f8a26474fafae04492561d842a329/2026-11/The_Wireless_Resdiences_PrivateLift_Lobby.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"Upper House Residences Bangkok 3房單位\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b5724cee434a75a622e46aa3b0794a6d/2026-11/Upper_House_Residences_Bangkok_3Bedroom_Kitchen.jpg\">\n<p>其中Upper House Residences Bangkok提供兩房至四房單位，面積約1,346至9,935方呎，售價由6,368.7萬泰銖起（折合約1,465萬港元）。</p>\n<img alt=\"The Wireless Resdiences by Upper House2房單位\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/560a482831858f5deb0c40122fe56f9b/2026-11/The_Wireless_Resdiences_2B_Master_Bedroom.jpg\" title=\"The Wireless Resdiences by Upper House2房單位\">\n<img alt=\"The Wireless Resdiences by Upper House2房單位\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f94b40d5fc5caf5cb6d4c58356fb3862/2026-11/The_Wireless_Resdiences_2B_MasterBathroom.jpg\" title=\"The Wireless Resdiences by Upper House2房單位\">\n<p>而The Wireless Residences by Upper House 則提供一房至四房單位，約915至8,288方呎，而來港開售的兩房單位售價由4,428.9萬泰銖起（折合約1,019萬港元）。</p>\n<p>整體規劃由Foster + Partners透過F&amp;P (Thailand) Ltd.構思，設計靈感源自傳統泰式別墅的優雅比例與寧靜空間，揉合園景花園，並着重私隱、自然採光及開揚景觀；園境設計則交由P Landscape主理。</p>\n<h2>Upper House Residences Bangkok：</h2>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5f1afa7d622cea7aa40d393b09165a37/2026-11/Interior_DLM51_T1_Lobby_1_FINAL.jpg\">\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7c6c8516b270d44d5d260b0faaef7f4b/2026-11/Interior_DLM50_T1_Lobby_FINAL.jpg\">\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/15cfabc5a210460c3f15c7d7c641b638/2026-11/Interior_DLM56_T1_L44_Thermal_Bath_FINAL.jpg\">\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dba754cdf864b8de842f813e7dd01238/2026-11/Landscape_DOF02_T1_Outdoor_Lounge_and_Garden_FINAL.jpg\">\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1ded7b436a9879314132ddff5e0739c6/2026-11/Landscape_DOF03_T1_Ground_Swimming_Pool_FINAL.jpg\">\n<h2>The Wireless Residences by Upper House：</h2>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/147e06164eb36c2cf2d685b40835e689/2026-11/Exterior_TB07_T1_Closeup_Exterior_FINAL.jpg\">\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8db2f7e57f95ffeeaa93d5b1c294dd23/2026-11/Interior_PIA71_T2_Lobby_1_FINAL.jpg\">\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f1ac2594ec57bc4981047d4ce4736179/2026-11/Interior_PIA77_T2_L42_Fitness_FINAL.jpg\">\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/21fac5732636b06a548ba9997d7029eb/2026-11/Interior_PIA78_T2_L42_Private_Dining_Room_FINAL.jpg\">\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6de81047d153da3de93da7375f04b876/2026-11/Landscape_DOF07_T2_Outdoor_Lounge_FINAL.jpg\">\n<p>Upper House Residences Bangkok的康體設施位於地面層及43至45樓，由GOCO Hospitality打造，設泳池、水療及蒸氣室、健身室及靜休空間，地面層亦設園景花園及俯瞰倫披尼公園的有蓋長廊。The Wireless Residences by Upper House的設施設於地面層、11樓及43樓，包括園林花園、遮蔭庭院、寵物友善步道、共享廚房、餐飲區、泳池、休息室、專屬家庭空間及43樓康體健身設施；兩座大樓日常營運及物業管理由居舍團隊負責，提供24小時禮賓、保安、行李服務、代客泊車及技術支援，並設多項自選服務。</p>\n<p>配套方面，項目鄰近主要購物中心如One Bangkok、Dusit Central Park及Central Embassy；國際學校則有Regent's Lang Suan、Raintree International School Sathorn及Shrewsbury International School Bangkok，前往曼谷蘇萬那普國際機場約40分鐘車程。</p>\n<p>海外買家須知方面，外籍買家可購入永久產權物業，惟須受外籍人士持有配額及泰國法例規限，外籍人士可擁有的永久產權分層住宅單位最高不得超過項目可售總樓面面積的49%；稅項方面，海外買家與泰國買家一樣，須繳付相當於政府估值1%的過戶費，泰國並無針對海外買家徵收額外稅項。</p>\n<p>相關文章：曼谷Upper House Residences來港推 逾千呎兩房約1019萬起</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T06:01:48.863759+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1538,"images":21,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T05:34:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T05:55:03.763655+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T05:55:03.763655+00:00","content_hash":"eeba83c65e87a8662ca27ca2f56a54a4551d96d667b5c49ab82312707e8c45df","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}